<p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<a href="https://youtu.be/8VzjDXPa9kg?t=1" target="_blank">No terror shall exist in my domain: only violent understandings.</a><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p>
</blockquote>
</div>
<p>A huge undertaking authored by yours truly, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3207203); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579678445" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3207203); return false;">JackalRelated</a></span>. Made with a lot of support, especially from these fellows:</p>
