<br />
Idea inspired from a forum post by user <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rainbowknishes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3489986); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3489986&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579678445" alt="Rainbowknishes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3489986)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rainbowknishes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3489986); return false;">Rainbowknishes</a></span> and a helping of classic Doctor Who aestheticism. A lot of religious undertones are in this skip as well. A decent amount of it didn't pass the chopping block, but it would have dragged on had I not removed it.
<p>Technically coldposted this since I didn't get any crit besides aesthetics prior to posting.</p>
<p>I worked on this for a loooong time, and I hope you all enjoy! Good luck and well wishes to the other 5kon competitors.</p>
<p><em>Writing music:</em> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=614hHSGJ9z8http://" target="_blank">Popcorn</a> and <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SNHQW5P3l4A" target="_blank">Little Russian</a>, both referenced in the skip.<br />
